=== refitting with intronic fraction as a covariate ===
NOTE: intronic fraction is 93% explained by group. A covariate that close to the grouping removes
      the group effect largely by construction, so a collapse below is
      evidence that the two are inseparable here - not that the
      biological difference has been refuted.
  acute_vs_control: 296 -> 4 DEGs
  subacute_vs_control: 471 -> 5 DEGs
  acute_vs_subacute: 2 -> 1 DEGs
